# Blade of Desires Stage 1 LostForestGrassBillboard
# Origin: local XY unit quad centered at (0,0,0); +X is visual right, +Y is visual up, Z=0, runtime UV v=0 is the visual top, and OBJ/Blender V is conventionally flipped
mtllib lost_forest_grass_billboard.mtl
o LostForestGrassBillboard
v -0.500000 -0.500000 0.000000
v 0.500000 -0.500000 0.000000
v 0.500000 0.500000 0.000000
v -0.500000 -0.500000 0.000000
v 0.500000 0.500000 0.000000
v -0.500000 0.500000 0.000000
vt 0.000000 0.000000
vt 1.000000 0.000000
vt 1.000000 1.000000
vt 0.000000 0.000000
vt 1.000000 1.000000
vt 0.000000 1.000000
vn 0.000000 0.000000 1.000000
vn 0.000000 0.000000 1.000000
vn 0.000000 0.000000 1.000000
vn 0.000000 0.000000 1.000000
vn 0.000000 0.000000 1.000000
vn 0.000000 0.000000 1.000000
usemtl LostForestGrassBillboardMaterial
f 1/1/1 2/2/2 3/3/3
f 4/4/4 5/5/5 6/6/6
